370
00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:24.340
Well, I watched that documentary, My Octopus Friend.
我看了那部纪录片，《我的章鱼老师》。

371
00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:25.800
I'll Never Eat Octopus Again.
我再也不会吃章鱼了。

372
00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:26.560
I'll say that.
我只能说。

373
00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:27.820
They're so smart.
它们太聪明了。

374
00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:28.500
I know.
我知道。

375
00:15:28.760 --> 00:15:29.740
So here we go.
那么，开始了。

376
00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:31.180
Deep dive on candy corn.
深入研究玉米糖。

377
00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.540
Here's what it's made up of.
