378
00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:40.800
Corn syrup, confectioner's glaze, salt, dextrose, gelatin, sesame oil, artificial flavor, honey,
玉米糖浆、糖果釉、盐、葡萄糖、明胶、芝麻油、人工香料、蜂蜜，

379
00:15:41.060 --> 00:15:42.460
and three different food colorings.
还有三种不同的食用色素。

380
00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:44.200
That all sounds fine, right?
听起来都没什么问题，对吧？

381
00:15:44.820 --> 00:15:45.380
Nothing alarming.
没什么好担心的。

382
00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:48.860
Now, gelatin is derived from animal parts.
明胶是从动物身上提取的。

383
00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:51.480
It's made up of like hide and bone.
它是由皮和骨头之类的东西制成的。

384
00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:54.160
And so candy corn is not vegan.
所以玉米糖不是纯素的。

385
00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:55.580
It's in everything.
什么东西里都有它。

386
00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:56.320
It's in everything.
什么东西里都有它。

387
00:15:56.880 --> 00:15:57.900
It's not vegan.
它不是纯素的。

388
00:15:57.900 --> 00:16:00.480
If you're vegan, you have to really look for the gelatin.
如果你是纯素食者，你真的得仔细看看有没有明胶。

389
00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:05.320
You also probably have to take vitamins and stuff that are real chalky.
你可能还得吃那种粉粉的维生素之类的东西。

390
00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:08.780
Oh, because of the gelatin in a lot of vitamins.
哦，因为很多维生素里都有明胶。

391
00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:11.480
I love that that's where your brain went.
我真喜欢你脑子里想到的这些。

392
00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:15.500
You were like, I feel bad for people who have to take the chalky vitamin, but I get it.
你当时就像是，我为那些不得不吃粉状维生素的人感到难过，但我理解。

393
00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:20.920
Some vitamins are really big and the little, you know, slick gelatin coating makes it slide
有些维生素很大，而那种滑滑的明胶外壳能让它滑

