00:16:59.420 --> 00:17:07.460
Yes, it is a secretion from tiny red insects called lac bugs.
没错，那是从一种叫紫胶虫的小红虫身上分泌出来的东西。

409
00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:08.320
Hmm.
嗯。

410
00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:12.620
And if you ever want to eat candy corn again, don't look up a picture of it.
如果你还想再吃玉米糖的话，千万别去搜它的图片。

