439
00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:20.760
Everything you wanted to know about candy corn.
关于玉米糖你想知道的一切都在这儿了。

440
00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:22.900
I'm still going to eat it.
我还是会吃的。

441
00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:24.800
