At 7 minutes and 55 seconds, Phyllis takes down the skeleton decoration that Aaron put up because it's just not, quote, Halloween-y enough.
在7分55秒处，菲利斯取下了艾琳挂的骷髅装饰，因为用她的话说，那不够有万圣节的感觉。

