00:37:30.140 --> 00:37:40.540
It really makes you even sadder for Aaron who was so eager to do a great job at her first party that she even borrowed ideas directly from Angela who just ripped them right off the wall.
这真的让你更替艾琳感到难过，她那么渴望在自己负责的第一场派对上表现出色，甚至直接借用了安吉拉的点子，而安吉拉却直接把它从墙上扯了下来。

