945
00:41:49.780 --> 00:41:53.580
This next scene is going to get us a note from Standards and Practices.
接下来的这一幕会让我们收到审查部门的警告。

946
00:41:54.300 --> 00:41:55.240
The finger.
竖中指。

947
00:41:55.620 --> 00:41:55.960
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

