The fog machine broke.
烟雾机坏了。

1035
00:45:51.400 --> 00:45:58.580
And while they were trying to fix it, I mean, Kate and Craig and Ellie and Ed, they improvised
当他们试图修理它的时候，我是说，凯特、克雷格、艾莉和艾德，他们即兴

1036
00:45:58.580 --> 00:45:59.340
a whole song.
创作了一整首歌。

1037
