1040
00:46:05.020 --> 00:46:06.520
And I'm going to post it.
我打算把它发出来。

1041
00:46:06.760 --> 00:46:08.680
And then you hear at the end of it.
然后你在最后能听到。

1042
00:46:08.760 --> 00:46:09.200
All right.
好了。

1043
00:46:09.560 --> 00:46:10.500
We're going back to one.
