1044
00:46:10.600 --> 00:46:11.740
The fog machine was fixed.
烟雾机修好了。

1045
00:46:12.120 --> 00:46:13.740
Yeah, I totally remember that.
是啊，我完全记得那件事。

1046
00:46:13.820 --> 00:46:17.720
