Steve Burgess said it was like a ton of editing to make that little moment like look good.
史蒂夫·伯吉斯说，为了让那个小片段看起来效果不错，他们做了大量的剪辑工作。

1073
00:47:49.580 --> 00:47:52.420
What the heck are they making the fakie Barbie dolls out of?
那些假芭比娃娃到底是用什么做的？

1074
00:47:52.620 --> 00:47:53.480
I don't know.
我不知道。

1075
00:47:54.560 --> 00:47:55.540
Unmelting things.
永不融化的东西。

1076
00:47:55.840 --> 00:47:57.620
