00:47:58.160 --> 00:48:02.340
Steve Burgess also said, you know, the shot of the cake where the goo comes out?
史蒂夫·伯吉斯还说，你知道，那个蛋糕里流出粘液的镜头吗？

1078
00:48:02.760 --> 00:48:03.260
Mm-hmm.
嗯。

